        "title": "Fill in the whole grid",
        "body": "With the numbers of uses found above (3, 2, 1, 4 for the upper positions and 4, 2, 1 for the lower ones), add up for each cell how many placements cover it. The finished grid is\n\n- row 1: 3, 3\n- row 2: 5, 6, 5, 4\n- row 3: 2, 3, 9, 8\n- row 4: 6, 7, 1\n- row 5: 2, 3, 1\n\nIt agrees with all the visible numbers, and the largest number is 9.\n\n**Answer: (D) 9**"
